{"id":"n47105-1-7","stage":3,"title":"도무지 · 根本","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n47105-1-7-1","ko":"걔는 나를 어떻게 생각하는지 도무지 모르겠어.","zh":"我完全不知道她是怎么看我的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"걔는","meaning":"“그 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。","explanation":"걔：“그 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"걔","audio":"/audio/6488cd1503b8fc1cb5fa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64369","senseId":"1","lemma":"걔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걔는","audio":"/audio/4f80e605ecec1a908349.mp3"}},{"text":"나를","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나를","audio":"/audio/4225b1c78642e45b4068.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"생각하는지","meaning":"认为，当作","explanation":"생각하다：认为，当作；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"생각하다","audio":"/audio/6ffd015ff4c3322ac70c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66376","senseId":"7","lemma":"생각하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생각하는지","audio":"/audio/32213efaa41240516d64.mp3"}},{"text":"도무지","meaning":"根本，完全","explanation":"도무지：根本，完全。","readings":[{"term":"도무지","audio":"/audio/425284f47c3c524b4b48.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47105","senseId":"1","lemma":"도무지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"도무지","audio":"/audio/425284f47c3c524b4b48.mp3"}},{"text":"모르겠어.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","au